OL,3,CView the partial solar eclipse in
OL,4,Cpictures
OL,6,FThousands of people across the Channel
OL,7,FIslands flocked to the coast, cliffs
OL,8,Fand high land on Wednesday evening to
OL,9,Fwatch the partial solar eclipse.
OL,11,FSome roads were gridlocked as groups
OL,12,Fheaded to popular spots, with car
OL,13,Fparks quickly filling up.
OL,15,FAt its peak just before 7:20pm, around
OL,16,F94% of the sun was blocked by the moon
OL,17,F- with clear skies allowing those
OL,18,Fwatching on to see some of the best
OL,19,Fviews across the British Isles.
